OL,3,GNEWSAHeating oil costs 'more than
OL,4,Adouble' ahead of winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds in Upper Teesdale are
OL,7,Fpreparing for winter with the cost of
OL,8,Fheating oil "more than double" what it
OL,9,Fwas compared to this time last year.
OL,11,FWith no mains gas supply in
OL,12,FMiddleton-in-Teesdale, most homes in
OL,13,Fthe area rely on heating oil to keep
OL,14,Fwarm, meaning residents can face bills
OL,15,Fof more than #1,000 at a time to fill
OL,16,Ftheir tanks.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
