OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHeating oil costs 'more than
OL,4,Adouble' ahead of winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent figures suggest households
OL,7,Facross rural areas including Teesdale,
OL,8,FWeardale, Northumberland and parts of
OL,9,FNorth Yorkshire are currently paying
OL,10,Faround #600 for a 500-litre delivery of
OL,11,Fheating oil, equivalent to about #1.19
OL,12,Fper litre.
OL,14,FIn October 2025, domestic heating oil
OL,15,Fprices were around 52p per litre.
